Temp workaround: use an autoloader (`autoloader="some_file.php"` in your `psalm.xml`) with the following:

```
<?php
define('SMARTY_PLUGINS_DIR', 'plugins/');
define('SMARTY_SYSPLUGINS_DIR', 'sysplugins/');
define('DS', '/');
```
